  ('inv-t-01', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 19, null, '“Priya''s train stopped between stations, and the lights went out.” What stopped it, and what does she do next?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-02', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 24, null, '“Nobody had opened the shop on the corner for ten years, until Dolores did this morning.” Who is Dolores, and what is she selling?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-03', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 23, null, '“Biscuit trotted into the house with a wallet in his mouth, and he dropped it at Malcolm''s feet.” What should Malcolm do next?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-04', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 18, null, '“At midnight, Ingrid heard the piano next door start playing again.” Who''s playing, and why only at midnight?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-05', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 26, null, '“The letter in Grace''s mailbox was addressed to someone who had never lived there.” Who was it meant for, and what does Grace do with it?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-06', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 23, null, '“Halfway up the mountain, Rafael the guide admitted to Lisa and Lionel he had never been this way before.” How do they respond?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-07', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 17, null, '“All of the houses on the street were dark, except for one.” What''s different about this house?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-08', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 15, null, '“Dianne opened the top drawer of the old desk, and found a carefully folded note.”', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-09', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 23, null, '“Captain Ruiz''s ferry left on time, with one passenger too many.” Who is the extra passenger, and where are they trying to go?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-10', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 25, null, '“Since the storm, the town''s clocks all showed different times.” What did the storm do to them, and how does anyone get anywhere on time?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-11', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 27, null, '“Marguerite tasted the soup and went very quiet. She had only tasted its equal once before.” What''s in the soup, and what does she do about it?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-12', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 20, null, '“Anton''s lost suitcase turned up on his doorstep, three years late.” Where has it been, and what''s in it now?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-13', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 25, null, '“The elevator opened onto a floor that wasn''t on the panel, and Rosa stepped out.” What''s on that floor, and who does she meet there?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-14', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 25, null, '“On the last day of school, Ms. Abara handed back a test nobody remembered taking.” What was the test on, and how did everyone do?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-15', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 24, null, '“Mrs. Lindqvist''s new tenant paid a year''s rent in coins.” Where did the coins come from, and what does the tenant do all day?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-16', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 20, null, '“Imani''s radio switched itself on in the middle of the night.” What was it playing, and who was it for?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-17', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 23, null, '“Beatrice noticed that two guests at the wedding were wearing the same disguise.” Who are they hiding from, and what does Beatrice do?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-18', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 20, null, '“Sanjay''s map ended at the river, but the footprints did not.” Who left the footprints, and where do they lead?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-19', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 21, null, '“When the tide went out, there was a door in the sand.” What''s behind the door, and who finds out first?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-20', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 24, null, '“Wanda, the babysitter, arrived an hour before anyone had called her.” How did she know, and what does she know that the family doesn''t?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-21', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 19, null, '“The last bus of the night was not on any schedule.” Where does it go, and who rides it?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-22', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 22, null, '“The orchestra began a piece that was not in the program.” Whose idea was it, and how does the audience take it?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-23', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 16, null, '“Jerome opened the fridge and found everything rearranged.” Who rearranged it, and what''s the new system?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-24', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 26, null, '“Edith, the lighthouse keeper, had not written in the log for nine days.” What happened on the first day, and what will her next entry say?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-25', 'invent', 'text', 'after', 'open', 2, 15, null, '“Fatima''s bakery sold out before it opened.” Who bought everything, and what''s it all for?', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-26', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 18, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: And that is why the piano is still in the garden.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-27', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 16, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: Nobody at the office ever mentioned the goat again.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-28', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 21, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: She kept the losing ticket in her wallet for the rest of her life.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-29', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 18, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: By morning, the bridge was open and the mayor was gone.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-30', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 17, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: They never did find out who had paid the bill.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-31', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 17, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The dog was the only one who got a medal.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-32', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 18, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: And so the restaurant kept the name, spelling mistake and all.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-33', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 16, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: He returned the trophy the next day, without explanation.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-34', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 16, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The twins agreed never to borrow the boat again.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-35', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 18, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: That was the last time anyone asked him to bring dessert.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-36', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 19, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: In the end, the tree stayed and the road went around it.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-37', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 18, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The teacher framed the note and hung it by the door.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-38', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 20, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: When the snow melted, the car was exactly where they had left it.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-39', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 17, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The cat came back with the key around its neck.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-40', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 17, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: After that, the choir always rehearsed with the windows shut.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-41', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 17, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The whole village showed up, and nobody remembered the cake.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-42', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 16, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: She mailed the shoes back with a thank-you card.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-43', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 19, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: It took three neighbors and a ladder, but the kite came down.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-44', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 16, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The parrot was never allowed near the telephone again.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-45', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 19, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: They split the prize four ways and never spoke of the fifth.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-46', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 17, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The museum hung it upside down, and no one noticed.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-47', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 17, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: He finally learned to swim, at the age of seventy.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-48', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 18, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The train left on time, and so, for once, did they.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-49', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 16, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The recipe is still taped inside the cupboard door.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-50', 'invent', 'text', 'before', 'open', 1, 16, null, 'Tell the story that ends this way: The umbrella was returned ten years later, still wet.', 'retired'),
  ('inv-t-51', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 29, null, 'If someone wanted to play a $1,000 game of hide and seek against you, and you could choose the location, where would you play? Would you hide, or seek?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-52', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 29, null, 'If you had to cook one dish with at least 4 ingredients to win a million-dollar game show prize, what would you make? Tell me how you''d make it.', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-53', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 25, null, 'If you were given a food truck and $5,000 to get it started, what would you sell? Where would you park it on opening day?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-54', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 29, null, 'If you could add one room to your home, free, but it could only be used for one thing, what would that room be for? What goes in it?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-55', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 22, null, 'If you had to survive 24 hours locked inside any store, which store would you pick? How would you spend the night?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-56', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 26, null, 'You''ve been handed the keys to a theme park for one night, and you can bring three people. Who comes, and what do you do first?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-57', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 24, null, 'If you had to teach a one-hour class tomorrow with no time to prepare, what would you teach? How would you start the lesson?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-58', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 26, null, 'If a stranger offered you $10,000 to give up one food forever, which food could you live without? Which food would cost them a lot more?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-59', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 26, null, 'You have to enter a talent show next week, and the winner gets a free trip anywhere. What''s your act, and how do you rehearse it?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-60', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 25, null, 'If you could put up one billboard anywhere, and it had to stay up for a year, where would it go? What would it say?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-61', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 18, null, 'You''re opening a restaurant with exactly five things on the menu. What are they? What''s the place called?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-62', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 28, null, 'If you had to plan a perfect day for a visitor with only $40 to spend, where would you take them? What''s the one stop you''d never skip?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-63', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 24, null, 'You get to invent a new holiday, and everyone gets the day off. What is it celebrating, and what does everybody do that day?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-64', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 28, null, 'If you had to get across your town as fast as possible without a car, with $500 on the line, how would you do it? Describe the route.', 'draft'),
  ('inv-t-65', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 25, null, 'If you could bring one extinct or imaginary animal home as a pet, which one? Where would it sleep, and what would the neighbors say?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-66', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 24, null, 'You''ve been given an empty storefront on a busy street, rent-free for a year. What do you open? What does it look like inside?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-67', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 26, null, 'If you had to spend a year living in a different decade, which one would you choose? What would you do on your first day there?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-68', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 23, null, 'You have ten minutes to pack one bag for a month somewhere you''ve never been. What goes in first? What gets left behind?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-69', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 22, null, 'If you had to host a dinner for three famous people, living or dead, who''s at the table? What are you serving?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-70', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 23, null, 'If you could make one small rule that everyone had to follow, nothing serious, what would it be? How would you enforce it?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-71', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 20, null, 'You''re designing a treehouse with no budget and no building codes. What''s in it? How do you get up there?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-72', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 27, null, 'If you had to pick one song to play every time you walked into a room for a year, which song? Which rooms would be a problem?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-73', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 26, null, 'A game show gives you 60 seconds in a grocery store, and you keep what you grab. Where do you run first? What do you skip?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-74', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 25, null, 'If you were handed a boat and a free month, where would you take it? Who would you bring, and who would do the cooking?', 'approved'),
  ('inv-t-75', 'invent', 'text', 'whatif', 'open', 2, 26, null, 'If you had to compete in a contest against a ten-year-old, and you got to choose the contest, what would you pick? How would it go?', 'approved'),
